+/*
+ * 0345: the barometer, as locationd's CLPressure opens it: usage pair {0x20, 0x31} (Sensor page,
+ * Environmental: Atmospheric Pressure; locationd 0x101431558), kIOHIDEventTypeAtmosphericPressure events
